# AI Instructions & Context

**Before doing anything in this repo, read [`AGENTS.md`](./AGENTS.md) in full.**
It is the single source of truth — architecture, deploy rules, dashboard conventions,
known gotchas, and a never-break checklist.

Quick reminders (full detail in AGENTS.md):
- Keep `bot/` lite — no heavy/bulky deps (Lambda size & cold start).
- Put new dashboard features in standalone `dashboard/components/` (with `'use client'`).
- Every `/api/*` route must be never-throw (wrap the whole body in `lib/store.js: serve()`)
  and return 200 + valid JSON. Sanitize `NaN` before responding.
- Never hardcode secrets — the repo is public.
